  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05346-000:NotesRegardingReservedPurchaseTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;６　買付予約高&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;リース契約及び割賦販売契約の成約による購入資産の買付予約高は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:28pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
